Package: JAGGview
Title: Static and Dinamic visualization of model results generated by JABBA
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(
        person("Thiago", "Pacheco", , "thiago_pacheco@edu.univali.br", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Rodrigo", "Sant'Ana", , "rsantana@univali.br", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Static and shiny application for visualizing results from models implemented 
    with JABBA, focusing on fit diagnostics, run tests, CPUE conflicts, process error, priors 
    vs. posteriors, and retrospective analyses, as well as sections for results (trajectories, 
    Kobe plots, and sensitivity analyses).
